98
00:06:08,702 --> 00:06:13,123
" How do you bring somebody round , having been asleep for two years ? "

99
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:17,044
I 'm Veronica Cartwright , and I play Lambert , the navigator .

100
00:06:17,211 --> 00:06:19,880
Tom Skerritt . I play Dallas .

101
00:06:20,047 --> 00:06:24,009
