108
00:06:47,241 --> 00:06:50,077
Maybe there 'll be a shot here and you can see that they 're wearing tape .

109
00:06:50,244 --> 00:06:51,370
( Skerritt ) Didn 't lose Harry or I.

110
00:06:51,537 --> 00:06:53,497
I think we were right there watching , weren 't we , Harry ?

