1803
01:51:21,217 --> 01:51:25,554
" Overcrank it all and it will look like plasma engine . "

1804
01:51:25,721 --> 01:51:28,808
They said " What 's a plasma engine ? " I said " I 've no idea , but it sounds good . "

1805
01:51:28,975 --> 01:51:32,353
And as far as I 'm concerned , it looks like a plasma engine , and that 's that .

1806
01:51:32,520 --> 01:51:36,816
That 's just water with an arc above it - obviously at a safe distance -

1807
01:51:36,983 --> 01:51:39,193
so when the water comes on , it rings .

1808
01:51:39,360 --> 01:51:44,824
The lights go on as well , and you get a sense of jet power .

1809
01:51:46,993 --> 01:51:49,996
( Rawlings ) Well , we wanted to linger on the demise of this creature

1810
01:51:50,162 --> 01:51:51,414
