1816
01:52:06,387 --> 01:52:09,557
If you could have done it three or four times , it would have just held anyway .

1817
01:52:09,724 --> 01:52:14,270
You just wanted to see this thing going forever .

1818
01:52:14,437 --> 01:52:16,397
Or hopefully .

1819
01:52:16,731 --> 01:52:20,067
I should reach the frontier in about six weeks .

1820
01:52:20,234 --> 01:52:25,281
( Scott ) I love all these oblique references to " frontier " and " six weeks . "

1821
01:52:25,448 --> 01:52:27,199
You don 't really know what the distances are ,

1822
