1835
01:53:09,325 --> 01:53:10,951
- ( Scott ) " That 's us ? " - ( Weaver ) Yeah , you can 't .

1836
01:53:11,118 --> 01:53:15,414
( Scott ) If you believe in the big bang , which is ... From that to where we are now ,

1837
01:53:15,581 --> 01:53:21,295
is such an accident of trillions of events to do the right thing

1838
01:53:21,462 --> 01:53:24,673
so that you can sit right here , is actually impossible .

1839
01:53:24,840 --> 01:53:28,969
So a scientist will say " It is actually the wand of God ,

1840
01:53:29,136 --> 01:53:32,473
or it 's a far more superior being that enables us to be sitting here . "

1841
